 e with a limit of three books per person. RULES *No textbooks\, reference 
 materials\, manuals or magazines*Max three books per person*Books in good 
 condition accepted (no yellowed pages\, speckling\, stains or major tears)
  We reserve the right to reject books that are not clean or readable*No ma
 ss dumping of books
